<div class="part-inner">
<section class="intro-panel double-glass">
<div class="section-label">Core model</div>
<p>Treat the wavefunction as the information object: it evolves by Schrödinger, gives probabilities through |ψ|², and collapses or branches or guides depending on interpretation. Boundary conditions turn waves into quantized eigenstates.</p>

</section>
